Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

As of 10/07/2026 the source tree contains no third-party code. Every source file
is either original MonkMode work (Copyright (C) 2026 Samrath Singh) or inherited
Cold Turkey code (Copyright (C) 2011-2012 Felix Belzile); both are GPLv3.

