Historical note - INI parser:
Earlier revisions bundled a third-party INI reader/writer, IniFileVb.vb
(originally "IniFile" by Ludvik Jerabek, published on CodeProject under the Code
Project Open Licence, CPOL 1.02). The Free Software Foundation lists the CPOL as
a non-free licence that is incompatible with the GPL. On 10/07/2026 that file was
removed and replaced by a clean-room GPLv3 implementation, IniFile.vb (and its
three sibling copies), Copyright (C) 2026 Samrath Singh. The original file, with
its author's attribution intact, remains in this repository's git history
(removed in commit 48ad4ea).
